# Normal T1 Arc builds need no build-time OpenAI key or Tarv1s service secret.
# API connections use the user's own OpenAI, Gemini or Claude key from Tarv1s
# settings. Optional ChatGPT sign-in uses no bundled API key or client secret.
# Credentials stay in Android secure storage, never in environment files.
#
# The disconnected mTLS research variables are documented separately in
# .env.mtls-poc.example. Do not copy them into a normal app build.
